"``comment_position``, ``create_collection``, ``add_to_collection`` — and "
"are offered only on request: ``--write`` locally, ``--mcp-write`` on the "
"daemon; ``rollout`` then gains the ``store`` argument, which records the "
"rollout beside the position's analysis. None deletes anything."

#: ../../source/mode_headless.rst:1634
